     "kids": [
      {
       "t": "html",
       "items": [
        {
         "t": "p",
         "html": "Afterwards, we conducted a survey on these students to further identify the core problem. From our survey, we discovered they want to have a voice. Of 72 students, <strong>61% want to give feedback to the dining hall</strong> so that they can get change. But from that same survey <strong>only 37% actually do so</strong>. What is more important to know is that <strong>when students are giving feedback how are they doing it</strong>?"
        },
        {
         "t": "h2",
         "html": "<strong>100%</strong> of students who give feedback want to do so <strong>DIRECTLY</strong> in dining halls."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "col",
     "span": 1,
     "kids": []
    }
   ]
