             "t": "h3",
             "html": "Competitive Analysis"
            },
            {
             "t": "h1",
             "html": "Current feedback channels are too <strong>SCATTERED </strong>and <strong>BROAD</strong>"
            },
            {
             "t": "p",
             "html": "There are multiple ways that students can provide feedback to the dining halls: surveys, the DineOnCampus app, the \"Text and Tell\" direct texting option, and the HappyOrNot rating system. Despite the availability of various feedback channels for the dining halls at the university, the process of gathering feedback through multiple channels poses challenges when it comes to timely review and analysis during critical moments."
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
